nd each side  they keep getting more and more guns  waiting for the army to leave and  therefore they should be taking in the  philosophy and I have also been  proposing recently at European level at  the European Union given that it's the  best example in the history of the world  of conflict resolution while it has many  departments and normal departments of  Agriculture etc and economic departments  it should also have a department of  peace and reconciliation and there  should be a European Commissioner for  peace and reconciliation and they should  take the philosophy down into the areas  of conflict and talk to the different  sides involved and bring in the  philosophy not an army okay  thank you very much  you

